      ✓  2 [desktop-chromium] › e2e/reconnect-snapshot.pw.ts:164:1 › a resume the host cannot answer is refused visibly and leaves a usable session behind (1.4s)
      ✓  3 [desktop-chromium] › e2e/reconnect-snapshot.pw.ts:204:1 › a real Web host restart reconnects, reports the lost session and becomes usable again (1.8s)
      ✓  4 [mobile-chromium] › e2e/reconnect-snapshot.pw.ts:121:1 › a dropped browser socket reconnects and restores the transcript from a server snapshot (1.8s)
      ✓  5 [mobile-chromium] › e2e/reconnect-snapshot.pw.ts:164:1 › a resume the host cannot answer is refused visibly and leaves a usable session behind (1.4s)
      ✓  6 [mobile-chromium] › e2e/reconnect-snapshot.pw.ts:204:1 › a real Web host restart reconnects, reports the lost session and becomes usable again (1.7s)

      6 passed (11.3s)

三条的分工不一样，值得写清楚：
第 1 条不重载页面，关掉套接字之后要求页面自己重连、发 `resume`（且 session id 与掉线前一致）、
拿到 `session_snapshot`，并且快照里的文本就是掉线前那段——即恢复出来的 transcript 来自主机而不是页面缓存；
第 2 条把 `resume` 里的 session id 改写成主机不认识的 id，要求错误被报出来、随后有一个新会话把输入框救活；
第 3 条不 mock 任何东西，`spawn` 真的 `target/debug/chaos-web`，SIGKILL 掉，再起一个。

第 3 条的两个进程断言是这轮改出来的，之前写错了一次：

    expect(firstHost.signalCode, 'the original host stayed alive').toBe('SIGKILL')
    expect(secondHost.exitCode, 'the replacement host died').toBeNull()
    expect(secondHost.signalCode, 'the replacement host died').toBeNull()

原本写的是 `expect(firstHost.exitCode).not.toBeNull()`，红了 `Received: null`。被信号停掉的进程
`exitCode` 就是 `null`、`signalCode` 才有值，所以「有 exitCode」在这里什么也不证明；断言必须落在
`signalCode === 'SIGKILL'` 上。`finally` 里的清理也跟着改：`if (child.exitCode === null && child.signalCode === null)`
才 kill，否则会对已死进程补刀。


